<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Transcript Request Form</title>
    <style>
        @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
        .page {
            width: 794px; height: 1123px;
            padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
            overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
            position: relative;
            font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; /* Using serif fonts as primary */
        }
        .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
        .header-logo { float: left; }
        .header-info { float: right; text-align: right; }
        .section-title { font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .form-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 15px; }
        .form-label { width: 30%; }
        .form-input { width: 65%; border-bottom: 1px solid #000; }
        .full-width-field { width: 100%; border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-bottom: 15px; }
        .divider { border-top: 1px solid #000; margin: 20px 0; }
        .signature-line { border-bottom: 1px solid #000; width: 50%; margin-top: 30px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="page">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
            <div class="header-logo">
                <img src="" alt="University Logo" style="height: 80px;">
                <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 10px;">
                    <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; margin: 0;">UNIVERSITY OF GUAM</h1>
                    <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin: 0;">UNIBETSEDAT GUAM</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="header-info">
                <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Graduate Admissions Office</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; text-align: center;">UNIVERSITY OF GUAM</h2>
            <p style="text-align: center; font-size: 10pt;">Graduate Admissions Office</p>
            <p style="text-align: center; font-size: 10pt;">303 University Drive, Mangilao, Guam 96913</p>
            <p style="text-align: center; font-size: 10pt;">Phone: <span data-field="contact.phone">{{ contact.phone }}</span> Fax: <span data-field="contact.fax">{{ contact.fax }}</span></p>
            <p style="text-align: center; font-size: 10pt;">e-mail: <span data-field="contact.email">{{ contact.email }}</span> website: <span data-field="contact.website">{{ contact.website }}</span></p>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
            <p style="font-weight: bold;">REQUEST FOR TRANSCRIPT: COLLEGE/UNIVERSITY</p>
            <p>It is the applicant's responsibility to mail this form to the appropriate college or university. Academic records must be mailed directly to the Graduate Admissions Office from the issuing institution.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
            <p style="font-weight: bold;">TO THE REGISTRAR/RECORDS CLERK:</p>
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 10px;">
                <div style="width: 45%;">
                    <p style="font-weight: bold;">COMPLETE NAME OF COLLEGE/UNIVERSITY</p>
                    <div class="full-width-field" data-field="complete_name_of_college_university">{{ complete_name_of_college_university }}</div>
                </div>
                <div style="width: 45%;">
                    <p style="font-weight: bold;">STREET ADDRESS</p>
                    <div class="full-width-field" data-field="street_address">{{ street_address }}</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 10px;">
                <div style="width: 20%;">CITY</div>
                <div style="width: 20%;">STATE</div>
                <div style="width: 20%;">ZIP CODE</div>
            </div>
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
                <div style="width: 20%;"><div class="full-width-field" data-field="zip_code">{{ zip_code }}</div></div>
                <div style="width: 20%;"><div class="full-width-field" data-field="zip_code_2">{{ zip_code_2 }}</div></div>
                <div style="width: 20%;"><div class="full-width-field" data-field="zip_code_3">{{ zip_code_3 }}</div></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
            <div class="form-row">
                <div class="form-label">Please Send:</div>
                <div class="form-input" style="width: 70%;">
                    <span data-field="transcript_type">{{ transcript_type }}</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="form-row">
                <div class="form-label">NAME (Type or print last name first)</div>
                <div class="form-input" style="width: 70%;">
                    <span data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="form-row">
                <div class="form-label">DATE OF BIRTH</div>
                <div class="form-input" style="width: 70%;" data-field="date_of_birth">{{ date_of_birth }}</div>
            </div>
            <div class="form-row">
                <div class="form-label">MAIDEN NAME (If applicable)</div>
                <div class="form-input" style="width: 70%;">
                    <span data-field="maiden_name">{{ maiden_name }}</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="form-row">
                <div class="form-label">PLACE OF BIRTH</div>
                <div class="form-input" style="width: 70%;" data-field="place_of_birth">{{ place_of_birth }}</div>
            </div>
            <div class="form-row">
                <div class="form-label">MAILING ADDRESS</div>
                <div class="form-input" style="width: 70%;" data-field="mailing_address">{{ mailing_address }}</div>
            </div>
            <div class="form-row">
                <div class="form-label">LAST TERM ATTENDED (Year)</div>
                <div class="form-input" style="width: 70%;" data-field="last_term_attended">{{ last_term_attended }}</div>
            </div>
            <div class="form-row">
                <div class="form-label">SOCIAL SECURITY NO.</div>
                <div class="form-input" style="width: 70%;" data-field="social_security_no">{{ social_security_no }}</div>
            </div>
            <div class="form-row">
                <div class="form-label">DATE OF GRADUATION (If applicable)</div>
                <div class="form-input" style="width: 70%;" data-field="date_of_graduation">{{ date_of_graduation }}</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="divider"></div>

        <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
                <div style="width: 50%;">
                    <p style="font-weight: bold;">Student's Signature:</p>
                    <div class="signature-line" data-field="student_s_signature">{{ student_s_signature }}</div>
                </div>
                <div style="width: 50%;">
                    <p style="font-weight: bold;">Date:</p>
                    <div class="signature-line" data-field="date">{{ date }}</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <p style="text-align: center; margin-top: 30px; font-weight: bold;">(PLEASE DETACH AND RETURN TO THE UNIVERSITY OF GUAM)</p>

        <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
            <p style="font-weight: bold;">TO THE GRADUATE ADMISSIONS OFFICE:</p>
            <p style="font-weight: bold;">SUBJECT: Transcript Request of:</p>
            <div class="full-width-field" style="height: 50px;" data-field="subject_transcript_request_of">{{ subject_transcript_request_of }}</div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
            <p style="font-weight: bold;">NAME OF STUDENT</p>
            <div class="full-width-field" style="height: 30px;" data-field="name_of_student">{{ name_of_student }}</div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
            <p>The transcript of the above named student is enclosed.</p>
            <p>There is no record of the above named student at this college or university.</p>
            <p>The transcript of the above named student cannot be released for the following reasons(s):</p>
            <div class="full-width-field" style="height: 50px;" data-field="field_1">{{ field_1 }}</div>
        </div>

        <div class="divider"></div>

        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 30px;">
            <div style="width: 45%;">
                <p style="font-weight: bold;">NAME & SIGNATURE</p>
                <div class="signature-line" data-field="name_signature">{{ name_signature }}</div>
            </div>
            <div style="width: 45%;">
                <p style="font-weight: bold;">SCHOOL/COLLEGE/UNIVERSITY</p>
                <div class="signature-line" data-field="school_college_university">{{ school_college_university }}</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 50px; font-size: 9pt; text-align: center;">
            <p>UOG Station, Mangilao, Guam 96923 Tel: (671) 735-2205 Fax: 735-2203</p>
            <p>A U.S. Land Grant Institution accredited by the Western Association of Schools and Colleges</p>
            <p>The University of Guam is an equal opportunity employer and provider</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>